title: 4CE — Sovereign On-Premise Agentic AI Workbench
message: If you reference this work, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Yash Kumar
    alias: Yash3510
repository-code: https://github.com/Yash3510/Multi-LLM-Agentic-Ai
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted agentic AI workbench for confidential industrial knowledge work.
  Tasks are routed across local open-weight models by type, grounded in the
  organisation's own documents, produced as real deliverables, challenged by an
  independent verification agent, and withheld until a person approves them.
  Built on Open WebUI. Submitted to Smart India Hackathon, problem statement
  26117 (Mangalore Refinery and Petrochemicals Limited).
keywords:
  - agentic-ai
  - on-premise
  - air-gapped
  - open-weight-models
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - industrial-ai
